  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - Mama Kit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Mama Kit. Location: Tegeta, Dar es Salaam. Summary: Tushinde Company Limited seeks to provide affordable delivery kits containing essential supplies needed by women during childbirth. These kits will contain clean and hygienic tools often required by rural women giving birth in rural health clinics. Tushinde Company Ltd. also plans to expand into Short Message Service (SMS) to provide pregnant women with important health information.</narrative>
  </description>
